{"audio": "1john-05.opus", "duration_ms": 162442, "sentences": [{"start_ms": 0, "end_ms": 3660, "text": "1 John, Chapter Five."}, {"start_ms": 4721, "end_ms": 12282, "text": "Everyone who believes that Jesus is the Christ has been born of God, and everyone who loves the Father also loves those born of Him."}, {"start_ms": 12962, "end_ms": 17902, "text": "By this we know that we love the children of God: when we love God and keep His commandments."}, {"start_ms": 18422, "end_ms": 21323, "text": "For this is the love of God, that we keep His commandments."}, {"start_ms": 21703, "end_ms": 26524, "text": "And His commandments are not burdensome, because everyone born of God overcomes the world."}, {"start_ms": 27144, "end_ms": 30764, "text": "And this is the victory that has overcome the world: our faith."}, {"start_ms": 31524, "end_ms": 32964, "text": "Who then overcomes the world?"}, {"start_ms": 33385, "end_ms": 36365, "text": "Only he who believes that Jesus is the Son of God."}, {"start_ms": 37085, "end_ms": 43826, "text": "This is the One who came by water and blood, Jesus Christ—not by water alone, but by water and blood."}, {"start_ms": 44606, "end_ms": 48947, "text": "And it is the Spirit who testifies to this, because the Spirit is the truth."}, {"start_ms": 49767, "end_ms": 56128, "text": "For there are three that testify: the Spirit, the water, and the blood—and these three are in agreement."}, {"start_ms": 57048, "end_ms": 61388, "text": "Even if we accept human testimony, the testimony of God is greater."}, {"start_ms": 61768, "end_ms": 64989, "text": "For this is the testimony that God has given about His Son."}, {"start_ms": 65849, "end_ms": 77210, "text": "Whoever believes in the Son of God has this testimony within him; whoever does not believe God has made Him out to be a liar, because he has not believed in the testimony that God has given about His Son."}, {"start_ms": 78271, "end_ms": 84011, "text": "And this is that testimony: God has given us eternal life, and this life is in His Son."}, {"start_ms": 84871, "end_ms": 90032, "text": "Whoever has the Son has life; whoever does not have the Son of God does not have life."}, {"start_ms": 91112, "end_ms": 97473, "text": "I have written these things to you who believe in the name of the Son of God, so that you may know that you have eternal life."}, {"start_ms": 98213, "end_ms": 104794, "text": "And this is the confidence that we have before Him: If we ask anything according to His will, He hears us."}, {"start_ms": 105374, "end_ms": 111115, "text": "And if we know that He hears us in whatever we ask, we know that we already possess what we have asked of Him."}, {"start_ms": 112275, "end_ms": 120016, "text": "If anyone sees his brother committing a sin not leading to death, he should ask God, who will give life to those who commit this kind of sin."}, {"start_ms": 120516, "end_ms": 125517, "text": "There is a sin that leads to death; I am not saying he should ask regarding that sin."}, {"start_ms": 126477, "end_ms": 130898, "text": "All unrighteousness is sin, yet there is sin that does not lead to death."}, {"start_ms": 132118, "end_ms": 139399, "text": "We know that anyone born of God does not keep on sinning; the One who was born of God protects him, and the evil one cannot touch him."}, {"start_ms": 140359, "end_ms": 144680, "text": "We know that we are of God, and that the whole world is under the power of the evil one."}, {"start_ms": 145120, "end_ms": 154801, "text": "And we know that the Son of God has come and has given us understanding, so that we may know Him who is true; and we are in Him who is true—in His Son Jesus Christ."}, {"start_ms": 155321, "end_ms": 157681, "text": "He is the true God and eternal life."}, {"start_ms": 158381, "end_ms": 161062, "text": "Little children, keep yourselves from idols."}], "words": [{"t": "1", "s": 0, "e": 2360, "si": 0}, {"t": "John,", "s": 2360, "e": 2620, "si": 0}, {"t": "Chapter", "s": 2840, "e": 3160, "si": 0}